# Tart VM images and working VMs — huge binary blobs, repo-local so
# they stay off the system volume, never committed. TART_HOME must
# be set to this directory (see tart/README.md) for every tart
# invocation in this repo. Everything under tart/ is excluded
# except the README which documents the layout.
tart/*
!tart/README.md

# Per-machine config picked up by scripts/vm-*.sh. Holds absolute
# paths (TART_HOME, etc.) that vary between developers — never commit.
.env

# sourcekit-lsp build-server config (xcode-build-server). Holds
# absolute paths (DerivedData build_root, workspace path) that vary
# per machine — regenerate with `xcode-build-server config`, don't commit.
buildServer.json

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Coverage profile data dropped by xcodebuild
*.profraw

# Build-phase generated bundle hash list. SteadingDefinitionValidator
# writes this on every build of the Steading target so the runtime
# can verify per-YAML integrity against build-time hashes; the file
# is regenerated each build, not source.
app/Steading/Resources/ServiceDefinitions/.bundle-hashes.plist

# Workflow docs
docs/discovery/*.md
